    <bpmn:process id="W_W4530" name="W4530. Captive Strategy, Structure &amp; Risk-Scope Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Feasibility go (W4529); risk-scope decision
Frequency: Per formation + periodic review
Volume: One captive strategy/structure/risk-scope
Owner: Risk (VS-21.2) / Treasury (VS-18) / CFO
Participants: Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100.3), Tax (VS-79), Actuarial
Source: workflow W4530 — Captive Strategy, Structure &amp; Risk-Scope Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4530_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4530_Lane1" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4530_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4530_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4530_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4530_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4530_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4530_Start3" name="Feasibility go (W4529); risk-scope decision">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4530_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4530_Task4" name="Risk/Treasury design the captive structure (pure captive vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Risk/Treasury design the captive structure (pure captive vs group/sister-captive vs protected-cell), ownership (held by BuildRight Holdings), and the risk scope it writes (e.g., property/cat retained layer, liability, fleet, cyber)
Responsible (R): Risk / Treasury / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO / Board
Duration: Per formation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4530_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4530_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4530_Task5" name="Risk/Actuarial set the retention layers (self-insured retention, captive layer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Risk/Actuarial set the retention layers (self-insured retention, captive layer, commercial/reinsurance above), aligned to risk appetite (VS-21.2) and commercial-market gaps
Responsible (R): Risk / Actuarial / Insurance
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / CFO
Duration: Per formation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4530_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4530_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4530_Task6" name="Risk/Legal/Tax document the strategy/structure, validate risk-transfer (real…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Risk/Legal/Tax document the strategy/structure, validate risk-transfer (real insurance, not financing-sham), and obtain board approval (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Risk / Legal / Tax
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Per formation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4530_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4530_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4530_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4530_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-112 (ensure captive risk-transfer adequacy.) | - CTL-689: captive structure bona-fide insurance (risk transfer); risk-scope actuarially gated; board-approved (VS-36)
Owner: Risk (VS-21.2) / Treasury (VS-18) / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4530_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4530_Annotation8" targetRef="W4530_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4530_Flow10" sourceRef="W4530_Start3" targetRef="W4530_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4530_Flow11" sourceRef="W4530_Task4" targetRef="W4530_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4530_Flow12" sourceRef="W4530_Task5" targetRef="W4530_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4530_Flow13" sourceRef="W4530_Task6" targetRef="W4530_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
