    <bpmn:process id="W_W4532" name="W4532. Captive Formation, Capitalization &amp; Legal Entity Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Domicile license (W4531); formation
Frequency: Per formation
Volume: One captive legal-entity formation + capitalization
Owner: Legal (VS-100.3) / Treasury (VS-18) / Corp Secretary (VS-36)
Participants: Tax (VS-79), Finance (VS-17), Board (VS-36), Auditors
Source: workflow W4532 — Captive Formation, Capitalization &amp; Legal Entity Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4532_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4532_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4532_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4532_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4532_Lane2" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4532_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4532_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4532_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4532_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4532_Start5" name="Domicile license (W4531); formation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4532_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4532_Task6" name="Legal/Corp Secretary form the captive legal entity (incorporation, articles…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Corp Secretary form the captive legal entity (incorporation, articles, bylaws, shareholder = BuildRight Holdings), register, and establish governance docs
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Secretary
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Board
Duration: Per formation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4532_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4532_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4532_Task7" name="Treasury/Finance capitalize the captive (paid-up capital…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/Finance capitalize the captive (paid-up capital, letter-of-credit/collateral per domiciliary requirement), fund from group treasury (VS-18), and book the investment
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
